---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Meyppi privacy policy: what we collect by source, why, sub-processors, retention, deletion, your rights, and exactly what the free check sends."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: 7 October 2026</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Meyppi, an independent media delivery verification practice
        based in India. Privacy contact:
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
        We respond to privacy questions and grievances within one working
        day.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect, by source</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Audit request form:</strong> name, company, role, email, campaign count range, spend range, and your one-line description. Used only to respond and scope an audit.</li>
        <li><strong>Email correspondence:</strong> whatever you choose to send.</li>
        <li><strong>Free check:</strong> see the section below; uploaded files never leave your browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Website analytics:</strong> Cloudflare Web Analytics aggregates page-view counts without cookies and without tracking individual visitors. No Google Analytics or cross-site tracking.</li>
        <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> standard edge-server request logs (URL, time, IP) kept by our hosting provider for security and abuse prevention.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>
        One purpose per data type. Form data and correspondence: responding
        and scoping. Client campaign material: producing the contracted
        report, processed only on your instructions under the Service
        Terms. Nothing is used for advertising or sold.
      </p>

      <h2>Client campaign material</h2>
      <p>
        Creatives and media rarely contain personal data; insertion orders
        and correspondence may. Client material is processed solely to
        produce your report, is stored as described on the
        <a href="/security">security and data handling</a> page, and is not
        shared with third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Sub-processors</h2>
      <p>
        Cloudflare (hosting, free-check proxy, optional cookieless
        analytics), Formspree (form handling, when used) and Google Fonts
        (typeface delivery). The current list with purposes and locations
        is on the <a href="/security">security page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are kept only as long as needed to respond and
        scope the request. Audit material (creatives, media and evidence
        exports) is retained so findings can be re-examined and is deleted
        on written request with confirmation; retention periods per
        engagement are stated in the engagement letter.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or erasure of your
        personal data, raise a grievance, or nominate a representative, by
        writing to
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
        We respond within one working day and action requests within a
        further five.
      </p>

      <h2>The free check, precisely</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Uploaded creative files are processed in your browser's memory and never leave your device.</li>
        <li>Audio URLs you paste are fetched through a streaming proxy that stores nothing and keeps no database record; standard edge request logs remain as above.</li>
        <li>The one-check limit is a value in your browser's local storage. The site sets no cookies and does not fingerprint visitors.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no cookies. There is no cookie banner because there
        are no cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>Security and breach notification</h2>
      <p>
        Measures and commitments are summarised on the
        <a href="/security">security page</a>. Affected clients are
        notified within 72 hours of an incident involving their material
        being confirmed.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        Material changes are announced on this page with a new effective
        date. This policy is written to India's DPDP framework; it is
        informational and not a substitute for legal advice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .muted {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
